# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Person-level All of Us Controlled Tier data. These must never reach a public
# repository. They were untracked by care rather than by rule until 2026-09-02,
# which is one `git add results/` away from a disclosure.
#
# The rule for this repository: results/ holds aggregate model output --
# coefficients, standard errors, balance tables, counts -- and nothing with one
# row per participant. When adding a new output, ask which it is.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
results/*/01_covid_cohort.csv
results/*/01b_phenotype_components_personlevel.csv
results/*/02_demographics.csv
results/*/03_charlson.csv
results/*/04_sdoh.csv
results/*/04b_sdoh_timing.csv
results/*/05_vaccination.csv
results/*/06_matching_variables.csv
results/*/07_matched_cohort.csv
results/*/08_regression_base.csv
results/*/09_sensitivity_flags.csv
results/*/*.rds
results/*/*.RData
results/*/*.fst
